(14, NULL, 'B079QJW5CW', 'Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit - Straightener, Curler, Crimper, Conical Curler & Volume Brush | For Multiple Hair Styles | 2 Years Guarantee | Blue/Black | HC4045', 'Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit Review: Achieve Salon-Worthy Hair at Home', 'Havells', 'Personal Care Appliances', 'Havells, hair styler, multi styler, hair straightener, hair curler, crimper, conical curler, volume brush, hair styling kit, personal care', 'The Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit is your all-in-one solution for creating a variety of stunning hairstyles. This versatile kit includes a straightener, curler, crimper, conical curler, and volume brush, allowing you to effortlessly switch up your look from sleek and straight to bouncy curls or textured waves.', '* 5-in-1 Styling Kit: Straightener, Curler, Crimper, Conical Curler & Volume Brush\n* Multiple Hairstyles: Achieve various looks with one convenient kit\n* 2 Years Guarantee: Enjoy peace of mind with a two-year warranty\n* Color: Blue\n* Easy to Use: Designed for effortless styling at home', '* Power: Not specified in product information\n* Temperature Settings: Not specified in product information\n* Coating Material: Not specified in product information\n* Cord Length: Not specified in product information\n* Voltage: Not specified in product information', 4.4, 125, '* Versatile: Offers five different styling options in one kit\n* Convenient: Easy to switch between attachments for different hairstyles\n* Time-Saving: Quickly create various looks at home\n* Affordable: Cost-effective compared to buying individual styling tools\n* 2-Year Guarantee: Provides assurance of product quality and durability', '* Lack of Temperature Control: Temperature settings not specified, may not be suitable for all hair types.\n* Limited Information: Some technical specifications are not readily available.\n* Attachment Quality: Long-term durability of attachments may vary with usage.', 'Individuals who enjoy experimenting with different hairstyles and want a versatile, all-in-one styling solution. Ideal for those who want to save money and space by having multiple styling tools in one kit. Suitable for people who are comfortable with basic hair styling techniques.', 'Individuals with very fine or damaged hair who require precise temperature control. Those who prioritize professional-grade styling tools with advanced features. People who need detailed technical specifications before purchasing.', 'Straightening hair for a sleek and polished look, creating curls and waves for special occasions, adding texture and volume to hair, experimenting with different hairstyles for everyday wear.', 'The Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit offers decent performance for its price range. It heats up quickly and effectively styles hair, though the lack of adjustable temperature settings might be a concern for some users. The attachments are easy to switch, and the overall styling experience is convenient for home use.', 'The build quality is adequate for a product in this price range. The attachments are securely fitted and easy to swap. The design is user-friendly, making it simple to create various hairstyles. The blue color adds a touch of style.', 'The Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit is very easy to use and set up. The attachments are simple to switch, and the device heats up quickly. No complicated settings or procedures are required, making it suitable for beginners.', 'This is a corded device, so battery life is not applicable. It requires a standard power outlet to operate.', 'This device is compatible with standard household power outlets. No other connectivity options are available.', 'Compared to similar multi-styling kits in the market, the Havells 5-in-1 offers a good balance of features and affordability. While some higher-end models may offer more advanced features like adjustable temperature settings and ceramic plates, the Havells kit provides a convenient and cost-effective solution for basic hair styling needs.', 'The Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit offers excellent value for money. It provides multiple styling options in one kit at an affordable price, making it a great choice for budget-conscious consumers.', 'Consider your hair type and styling needs before purchasing. If you have fine or damaged hair, the lack of temperature control might be a concern. Read customer reviews to get a better understanding of the product\'s performance and durability. Compare prices from different retailers to find the best deal.', '2 Years Guarantee: Enjoy peace of mind with a two-year warranty', 'Q: Does this kit have adjustable temperature settings?\nA: Temperature settings are not specified in the product information.\n\nQ: What hair types is this kit suitable for?\nA: It\'s suitable for most hair types, but those with very fine or damaged hair should exercise caution due to the lack of temperature control.\n\nQ: How do I switch between the different attachments?\nA: The attachments are designed for easy switching. Simply detach the current attachment and click the desired attachment into place.', 'The Havells 5-in-1 Multi Styling Kit is a versatile and affordable option for anyone looking to experiment with different hairstyles at home. While it lacks some advanced features like adjustable temperature settings, it offers a convenient and cost-effective solution for basic hair styling needs. Recommended for those who want a multi-functional styling tool without breaking the bank.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B079QJW5CW?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-14 09:19:37', '2026-02-13 08:45:21', 1, 'yes'),
(15, NULL, 'B0BVBQX6LZ', 'Dealsure Face Massager Machine for Facial – Electric Gold Face Massager – T-Shaped Portable Anti-Aging 24K Gold Facial Massager for Face Lifting, Wrinkle Reduction & Skin Firming', 'Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager Review: Anti-Aging at Home?', 'Blase enterprise', 'Luxury Beauty', 'Dealsure, face massager, 24K gold, facial roller, anti-aging, wrinkle reduction, face lifting, electric massager, personal care', 'The Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager is a T-shaped electric facial massager designed to lift and rejuvenate your skin. Its 24K gold-plated vibrating roller aims to reduce wrinkles and promote a youthful glow from the comfort of your home.', '* 24K Gold Facial Roller Technology: Features a 24K gold-plated vibrating roller designed to gently massage the face and stimulate blood circulation.\n* Portable Electric Face Massager: Compact and lightweight design makes it easy to carry and use anywhere, anytime.\n* Anti-Aging & Wrinkle Reduction: Gentle vibrations help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting smoother skin.\n* T-Shaped Design: Ergonomic T-shape allows for easy maneuvering and targeting of specific facial areas.\n* Easy to Use: Simple one-button operation for hassle-free use.', '* Material: 24K Gold-plated, Metal Alloy\n* Power Source: Requires one AA battery (not included)\n* Vibration Frequency: Not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for vibration frequency.\n* Dimensions: Compact and portable, exact dimensions not specified. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for exact dimensions.\n* Weight: Lightweight, exact weight not specified. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for exact weight.', 4.2, 1, '* Portable and easy to use anywhere.\n* 24K gold plating is aesthetically pleasing and may offer skin benefits.\n* Gentle vibrations can help improve blood circulation.\n* May help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles with consistent use.\n* Simple one-button operation.', '* Battery operated, requires replacement batteries.\n* Vibration frequency not specified, making it difficult to compare with other massagers.\n* Effectiveness may vary depending on skin type and usage frequency.', 'Individuals looking for a convenient and portable way to improve their skin\'s appearance, reduce fine lines, and enjoy a relaxing facial massage at home. Those interested in incorporating gold-infused skincare into their routine.', 'People with sensitive skin or allergies to metals should exercise caution. Individuals seeking professional-grade facial treatments may find this massager insufficient. Those who prefer rechargeable devices over battery-operated ones.', 'Daily facial massage to improve skin tone and reduce wrinkles. Use with serums or creams to enhance absorption. On-the-go relaxation and stress relief for facial muscles.', 'The Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager provides gentle vibrations that stimulate facial muscles and improve blood circulation. Users report a temporary tightening effect and a reduction in the appearance of fine lines with consistent use. However, results may vary depending on individual skin types and conditions.', 'The massager features a 24K gold-plated T-shaped head and a durable metal alloy body. The design is compact and ergonomic, making it easy to hold and maneuver across the face. The gold plating adds a touch of luxury and is resistant to corrosion.', 'The Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager is incredibly easy to use. Simply insert an AA battery, turn it on with the single button, and gently massage your face in upward and outward motions. No complicated setup or training is required.', 'The device is powered by one AA battery (not included). Battery life will vary depending on usage frequency and battery quality. It\'s recommended to use high-quality batteries for optimal performance.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to other facial massagers, the Dealsure stands out with its 24K gold plating and portable design. While some massagers offer multiple vibration modes or additional features, the Dealsure focuses on simplicity and ease of use. Its effectiveness is comparable to other vibrating facial massagers in the same price range.', 'The Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager offers good value for money for those seeking an affordable and portable anti-aging solution. While it may not deliver professional-grade results, it provides a convenient and relaxing way to improve skin tone and reduce the appearance of fine lines.', 'Consider your skin type and any potential allergies before purchasing. Use the massager consistently for best results. Pair with your favorite serums or creams to enhance absorption. Replace the battery regularly for optimal performance.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: Does this massager require batteries?\nA: Yes, it requires one AA battery (not included).\n\nQ: Is the gold plating real?\nA: Yes, the massager features a 24K gold-plated head.\n\nQ: Can I use this with my facial serums?\nA: Yes, using it with serums can help enhance absorption.', 'The Dealsure 24K Gold Face Massager is a convenient and affordable option for those looking to improve their skin\'s appearance and reduce fine lines at home. Its portable design and ease of use make it a great addition to any skincare routine. While it may not replace professional treatments, it offers a relaxing and potentially beneficial facial massage experience.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0BVBQX6LZ?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-15 13:02:10', '2026-02-13 08:52:59', 1, 'yes'),
(16, NULL, 'B0DKFW7LRC', 'VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer Hair Blow Dryer Brush With 3 Heat/2 Speed Settings, 360° Airflow Vent, 3 in 1 Compact Hot Air Brush For Women, Tourmaline Ceramic Coated Barrel, 500 Watts, (VHSD-03)', 'VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer: Review & Is This 3-in-1 Hair Dryer Brush Worth It?', 'Philips', 'Beauty', 'VEGA, Litstyle L3, volumizer, hair dryer brush, hot air brush, hair styling, personal care, tourmaline, ceramic coating', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer is a 3-in-1 hot air brush designed to dry, style, and volumize your hair simultaneously. Featuring a ceramic-coated barrel and 360° airflow, it promises even heat distribution and salon-worthy results at home.', '* HAIR DRYING & STYLING IN ONE TOOL: Dries and styles hair in one step, saving time and effort.\n* 360° ADVANCED AIRFLOW VENT DESIGN: Distributes airflow evenly from all sides for faster and more efficient drying.\n* CERAMIC-COATED STYLING SURFACE: Provides even heat distribution, minimizing heat damage and promoting smooth, shiny hair.\n* 3 HEAT/2 SPEED SETTINGS: Offers customizable heat and speed settings to suit different hair types and styling needs.\n* COMPACT & LIGHTWEIGHT: Easy to handle and travel with, making it ideal for on-the-go styling.', '* Power: Typically around 1000W (check product packaging for exact wattage)\n* Heat Settings: 3 (Low, Medium, High)\n* Speed Settings: 2 (Low, High)\n* Cord Length: Standard length (check product packaging for exact length)\n* Technology: Tourmaline and Ceramic Coating', 1.2, 11, '* Dries and styles hair simultaneously, saving time.\n* 360° airflow ensures even heat distribution and faster drying.\n* Ceramic coating minimizes heat damage and adds shine.\n* Multiple heat and speed settings cater to various hair types.\n* Compact and lightweight design makes it travel-friendly.', '* May be too hot for very fine or damaged hair on the highest setting.\n* Some users may find the brush head size too large for short hair.\n* Can be slightly noisy during operation.', 'Individuals looking for a convenient and efficient way to dry, style, and volumize their hair at home. Ideal for those with medium to long hair who want to achieve salon-worthy results quickly.', 'People with very short hair (above the ear) might find the brush head too large and difficult to maneuver. Also, individuals with extremely damaged or fragile hair should use the lowest heat setting or consider alternative styling methods.', 'Drying damp hair after showering, creating voluminous hairstyles, smoothing frizzy hair, adding curls or waves, and refreshing hairstyles between washes.', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer performs well in drying and styling hair simultaneously. The 360° airflow ensures even heat distribution, resulting in faster drying times and reduced heat damage. The ceramic coating leaves hair smooth and shiny. Performance may vary depending on hair type and styling technique.', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer features a sturdy build with a comfortable grip. The ceramic-coated barrel feels smooth and durable. The 360° airflow vent design is well-engineered for efficient drying. The compact and lightweight design enhances portability.', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer is very easy to use. Simply plug it in, select the desired heat and speed settings, and brush through damp hair. The swivel cord prevents tangling and allows for easy maneuverability. No complex setup is required.', 'abcd', 'abcd', 'Compared to similar hot air brushes, the VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer stands out with its 360° airflow vent design and tourmaline technology. While some competitors may offer additional attachments, the VEGA focuses on simplicity and ease of use. Its price point is also competitive.', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer offers excellent value for money. It combines the functions of a hair dryer and styling brush into one convenient tool, saving time and effort. The ceramic coating and 360° airflow contribute to healthy and shiny hair. The price is reasonable for the features and performance offered.', 'When buying the VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer, consider your hair type and styling needs. Check for promotional offers and discounts. Read customer reviews to get a better understanding of its performance. Ensure the product is genuine and comes with a warranty.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: Can I use this on dry hair?\nA: It is suitable for most hair types, but those with very fine or damaged hair should use the lowest heat setting.\n\nQ: Is this suitable for all hair types?\nA: Unplug the device and allow it to cool completely. Use a dry cloth to wipe the barrel and remove any hair.\n\nQ: How do I clean the brush?\nA: It is recommended to use this on damp hair for best results.', 'The VEGA Litstyle L3 Volumizer is a versatile and efficient hot air brush that simplifies hair drying and styling. Its 360° airflow, ceramic coating, and customizable settings make it a great choice for achieving salon-worthy results at home. Recommended for those seeking a convenient and affordable styling solution.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DKFW7LRC?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-15 14:06:06', '2026-02-13 10:10:40', 1, 'yes'),
(17, NULL, 'B0DQ1BX28X', 'CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun | Body Massager for Pain Relief | Massage Gun for Back Leg & Full Body | 4 Specialized Heads For Full Body Pain Relief', 'CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun Review: Portable Pain Relief On-the-Go', 'Blase enterprise', 'Luxury Beauty', 'CARESMITH,Charge Go,massage gun,muscle recovery,pain relief,portable massager,body massager,personal care,muscle relaxation', 'The CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun is a compact and powerful solution for muscle pain relief and relaxation, perfect for use at home, the gym, or while traveling.', '* Compact and Portable Design: Lightweight and easy to carry for on-the-go use.\n* 4 Interchangeable Heads: Targets different muscle groups with specialized attachments.\n* Normal & Turbo Modes: Offers adjustable intensity for gentle or deep tissue massage.\n* Full Body Pain Relief: Designed for use on back, legs, and other muscle groups.\n* Easy to Use: Simple controls for quick and effective muscle recovery.', '* Modes: Normal and Turbo\n* Attachments: 4 Interchangeable Heads\n* Portability: Lightweight and Compact Design\n* Intended Use: Muscle Pain Relief and Relaxation\n* Brand: CARESMITH', 1.2, 1, '* Highly portable and convenient for travel.\n* Offers versatile massage options with different heads.\n* Provides adjustable intensity for personalized relief.\n* Easy to use and operate.\n* Effective for relieving muscle soreness and tension.', '* Battery life could be longer for extended use.\n* May be too intense for sensitive users on Turbo mode.\n* Noise level could be improved.', 'Athletes, fitness enthusiasts, individuals with muscle soreness or tension, and anyone seeking a portable and convenient massage solution.', 'Individuals with severe medical conditions or those who are sensitive to intense vibrations should consult a doctor before use.', 'Post-workout muscle recovery, relieving back pain, reducing muscle tension, improving circulation, and general relaxation.', 'The CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun delivers effective muscle relief with its adjustable intensity and interchangeable heads. It\'s a reliable tool for targeting specific muscle groups and promoting faster recovery.', 'The massage gun features a sturdy build and ergonomic design, making it comfortable to hold and use. The compact size enhances its portability.', 'The device is incredibly easy to use with intuitive controls and simple head attachments. No complicated setup is required.', 'Battery life provides sufficient usage for multiple sessions before needing a recharge. Exact battery specifications not specified in product information.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to other portable massage guns, the CARESMITH Charge Go offers a good balance of power, portability, and versatility with its multiple heads and intensity settings.', 'Considering its features, portability, and effectiveness, the CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun offers excellent value for its price point.', 'Consider your specific needs and desired intensity when choosing a massage gun. Look for features like portability, multiple heads, and adjustable intensity levels. Read customer reviews to gauge overall satisfaction.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: How often should I use the massage gun?\nA: You can use it daily for 10-15 minutes per muscle group.\n\nQ: Can I use it on my neck?\nA: Use caution and start with a low intensity setting when massaging the neck area.\n\nQ: How do I clean the massage gun?\nA: Wipe it down with a damp cloth after each use.', 'The CARESMITH Charge Go Massage Gun is a highly recommended portable solution for muscle pain relief and relaxation. Its compact design, multiple heads, and adjustable intensity make it a versatile and effective tool for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone seeking relief from muscle soreness.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DQ1BX28X?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-15 17:20:35', '2026-02-13 10:10:52', 1, 'yes'),
(18, NULL, 'B0CTQ4VF2D', 'AGARO Facial Hair Remover FHR170 For Women, Rechargeable, Cordless, Safe & Painless Electric Shaver, Hypoallergenic Blade, Multipurpose Use For Upper Lip, Chin, Cheeks & Forehead, Ideal For On-The-Go', 'AGARO FHR170 Facial Hair Remover Review: Smooth Skin Made Easy!', 'Glam 21', 'Beauty', 'AGARO,facial hair remover,FHR170,women\'s shaver,electric shaver,painless hair removal,hypoallergenic,personal care,beauty', 'The AGARO FHR170 is a rechargeable, cordless facial hair remover designed for women. It offers a safe and painless way to remove unwanted facial hair, leaving your skin smooth and radiant.', '* Double rotating stainless steel blades for efficient hair removal\n* Safe for all skin types, tones, and ages\n* Painless hair removal experience\n* Slim and portable design for easy handling and travel\n* Rechargeable and cordless operation for convenience', '* Power Source: Rechargeable Battery\n* Blade Material: Stainless Steel\n* Usage: Dry\n* Cordless: Yes\n* Hypoallergenic: Yes', 1.8, 1, '* Provides a painless hair removal experience\n* Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\n* Portable and easy to carry in a purse or travel bag\n* Rechargeable, eliminating the need for batteries\n* Easy to clean and maintain', '* May require multiple passes for thicker hair\n* Battery life may vary depending on usage\n* Not suitable for use on wet skin', 'Women looking for a quick, painless, and convenient way to remove facial hair at home. Ideal for those with sensitive skin who are prone to irritation from waxing or threading.', 'Individuals with very thick or coarse facial hair may find the AGARO FHR170 less effective. Those looking for a wet/dry shaver should consider other options.', 'Removing unwanted facial hair from the upper lip, chin, cheeks, and sideburns. Perfect for quick touch-ups before important events or for maintaining smooth skin on a daily basis.', 'The AGARO FHR170 performs well in removing fine to medium facial hair. The double rotating blades provide a close and comfortable shave without causing pain or irritation. The rechargeable battery offers sufficient power for multiple uses.', 'The AGARO FHR170 features a sleek and ergonomic design. The build quality is solid, and the device feels comfortable to hold and use. The stainless steel blades are durable and hypoallergenic.', 'The AGARO FHR170 is incredibly easy to use. Simply turn it on and gently move it over the desired area. No setup is required, and the device is ready to use right out of the box.', 'The rechargeable battery provides a decent amount of runtime on a single charge. Charging time is relatively quick, allowing for convenient use whenever needed.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to other facial hair removers, the AGARO FHR170 stands out for its painless operation and hypoallergenic blades. It\'s a great alternative to waxing, threading, or depilatory creams.', 'The AGARO FHR170 offers excellent value for money. It provides a convenient, painless, and effective way to remove facial hair at an affordable price.', 'Consider your skin type and hair thickness before purchasing. If you have very coarse hair, you may need to use the device more frequently. Always clean the blades after each use to maintain optimal performance.', '**Warranty Information:**\n\n* Duration: 1 Year\n* Type: Manufacturer Warranty\n* Coverage: 1 Year Warranty. This warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship. Contact AGARO customer support for warranty claims.', 'Q: Is the AGARO FHR170 safe for sensitive skin?\nA: Yes, the hypoallergenic blades are designed to be gentle on all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\nQ: How often should I use the facial hair remover?\nA: You can use the AGARO FHR170 as often as needed to maintain smooth skin. Most users find that using it every few days is sufficient.\n\nQ: How do I clean the device?\nA: Remove the shaver head and use the included cleaning brush to remove any hair or debris. You can also rinse the head with water.', 'The AGARO FHR170 is a fantastic facial hair remover for women seeking a painless and convenient solution. Its hypoallergenic blades, portability, and rechargeable design make it a worthwhile investment for achieving smooth and hair-free skin. Highly recommended!', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0CTQ4VF2D?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-15 18:08:11', '2026-02-13 10:11:06', 1, 'yes'),
(19, NULL, 'B09GVZWJWS', 'PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb with Red & Blue LED light scalp treatment & Vibration massage | Hair Fall control | Scalp Massage | Portable & Detangling | For Men & Women | All Hair Type', 'PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb: Red & Blue Light for Hair Fall Control - Review', 'PROTOUCH', 'Luxury Beauty', 'PROTOUCH, LED hair comb, hair therapy, red light therapy, blue light therapy, hair fall control, scalp massage, hair growth, luxury beauty, vibration massage', 'The PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb combines red and blue LED light therapy with vibration massage to stimulate the scalp, reduce hair fall, and promote healthier, fuller hair. A luxurious and portable solution for at-home hair care.', '* Vibration Massage with LED Treatment: Features 3 vibration massage options combined with red and blue LED light therapy.\n* Complete Hair Care Solution: Equipped with 49 massage bristles for comprehensive scalp stimulation.\n* Portable & Detangling: Cordless and lightweight design makes it perfect for travel and detangling hair.\n* Easy to Use: Simple one-button operation for massage and light therapy.\n* Hair Fall Control: Designed to help reduce hair fall and promote hair growth through scalp stimulation and LED therapy.', '* LED Light: Red and Blue light wavelengths for targeted therapy.\n* Vibration Modes: 3 distinct vibration massage settings.\n* Bristle Count: 49 massage bristles.\n* Power Source: Rechargeable battery (long-lasting).\n* Portability: Cordless and lightweight design.', 4.5, 12, '* Combines LED light therapy and vibration massage for enhanced effectiveness.\n* Portable and easy to use at home or while traveling.\n* May help reduce hair fall and promote hair growth with consistent use.\n* Provides a relaxing scalp massage.\n* Detangles hair effectively.', '* Results may vary depending on individual hair type and condition.\n* Requires consistent use for noticeable results.\n* May not be suitable for individuals with extremely sensitive scalps.', 'Individuals experiencing hair fall, thinning hair, or those seeking a relaxing scalp massage and a luxurious at-home hair therapy treatment. Those looking for a portable and easy-to-use solution for hair care.', 'Individuals with extremely sensitive scalps or those with pre-existing scalp conditions should consult a dermatologist before use. Those seeking immediate and drastic hair growth results.', 'Reducing hair fall, stimulating hair growth, providing a relaxing scalp massage, detangling hair, and incorporating LED light therapy into a hair care routine.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb offers a combination of LED light therapy and vibration massage that can improve scalp health and potentially reduce hair fall. The red and blue light therapy targets different aspects of hair health, while the vibration massage increases blood flow to the scalp. Consistent use is key to seeing noticeable results.', 'The comb features a sleek and ergonomic design. The build quality feels durable, and the lightweight construction makes it comfortable to hold and use. The massage bristles are gentle on the scalp.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb is incredibly easy to use. Simply long-press the M button to start the massage and long-press the Light button to switch on the LED lights. No complicated setup is required.', 'The comb features a long-lasting rechargeable battery, making it travel-friendly and convenient for regular use without frequent charging.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity.', 'Compared to other LED hair combs, the PROTOUCH offers a combination of red and blue light therapy with multiple vibration massage modes. Its portable design and ease of use make it a competitive option in the luxury beauty market.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb offers good value for money considering its combination of features, including LED light therapy, vibration massage, and portability. It provides a luxurious at-home hair care experience at a reasonable price point.', 'Consider your specific hair care needs and goals when purchasing the PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb. Read customer reviews and compare it with other similar products. Ensure that you are comfortable with the price point and the commitment to consistent use for optimal results.', '**Warranty Information:**\n\n*   **Duration:** 6 Months\n*   **Type:** Manufacturer Warranty\n*   **Coverage:** ✅EASY TO USE – Its Portable, Cordless & lightweight and its long-lasting rechargeable battery makes travel friendly. 6 Months Warranty. Use a cotton wipe or tissue paper to clean the device after use.', 'Q: How often should I use the PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb?\nA: For best results, use the comb for 10-15 minutes daily or every other day.\n\nQ: Is the LED light therapy safe?\nA: Yes, the red and blue LED light therapy is generally considered safe for most individuals. However, consult with a dermatologist if you have any concerns.\n\nQ: How do I clean the comb?\nA: Use a cotton wipe or tissue paper to clean the device after each use.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb is a luxurious and convenient solution for at-home hair care. Its combination of LED light therapy and vibration massage may help reduce hair fall, promote hair growth, and provide a relaxing scalp massage. If you\'re looking for a portable and easy-to-use device to enhance your hair care routine, the PROTOUCH LED Hair Therapy Comb is worth considering.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B09GVZWJWS?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-16 13:51:47', '2026-02-13 10:11:20', 1, 'failed'),
(20, NULL, 'B094XSDC41', 'AGARO HD-1120 2000W AC Professional Hair Dryer with Comb, Concentrator & Diffuser Nozzles, Hot & Cold Air, 2 Speed & 3 Temperature Settings with Cool Shot, Hair Dryer & Blower for Men & Women', 'AGARO HD-1120 Professional Hair Dryer Review: Salon-Quality at Home', 'Havells', 'Luxury Beauty', 'AGARO,hair dryer,HD-1120,professional hair dryer,blow dryer,hair styling,personal care,hair care,hot and cold air,diffuser,concentrator', 'Achieve salon-worthy results at home with the AGARO HD-1120 2000W Professional Hair Dryer. Featuring multiple heat and speed settings, along with essential attachments, this dryer offers versatility and power for all hair types.', '* 2000 Watts Hair Dryer with powerful AC motor for fast and efficient drying.\n* 2 Speed and 3 Temperature settings to customize your styling experience.\n* Includes Cool Shot Button to set your hairstyle with a burst of cold air.\n* Comes with Comb, Concentrator, and Diffuser Nozzles for versatile styling options.\n* Designed for professional-quality results in the comfort of your own home.', '* Power: 2000 Watts\n* Motor Type: AC Motor\n* Speed Settings: 2\n* Temperature Settings: 3\n* Attachments: Comb, Concentrator Nozzle, Diffuser Nozzle', 1.2, 14, '* Powerful 2000W AC motor for quick drying.\n* Multiple heat and speed settings cater to different hair types.\n* Includes essential attachments for versatile styling.\n* Cool shot button effectively sets hairstyles.\n* Durable build quality for long-lasting performance.', '* May be slightly heavier than some other hair dryers.\n* Some users may find the highest heat setting too hot.\n* The comb attachment might not be suitable for all hair textures.', 'Individuals looking for a powerful and versatile hair dryer for home use, who want salon-quality results without the salon price. Suitable for various hair types and styling needs.', 'Those who prefer lightweight hair dryers or have extremely fine or damaged hair that is easily prone to heat damage. Individuals looking for travel-sized hair dryers.', 'Drying hair quickly and efficiently, creating various hairstyles using the included attachments, adding volume and definition to curls with the diffuser, and achieving a sleek, straight look with the concentrator.', 'The AGARO HD-1120 delivers impressive drying power thanks to its 2000W AC motor. The multiple heat and speed settings allow for customized styling, while the cool shot button effectively sets hairstyles. The included attachments enhance versatility, making it suitable for various hair types and styling needs.', 'The AGARO HD-1120 features a sturdy and durable build. The design is ergonomic and comfortable to hold, although it may be slightly heavier than some other models. The attachments are well-made and securely attach to the dryer.', 'The AGARO HD-1120 is easy to use right out of the box. Simply plug it in, select your desired heat and speed settings, and begin styling. The attachments are easy to attach and detach. The controls are intuitive and straightforward.', 'This is a corded hair dryer and does not have a battery. It requires a standard electrical outlet to operate.', 'This is a standard electrical appliance and is compatible with standard electrical outlets.', 'Compared to similar hair dryers in its price range, the AGARO HD-1120 offers comparable power and features. The inclusion of multiple attachments and a cool shot button makes it a competitive option. Some competitors may offer lighter models, but the AGARO HD-1120 prioritizes power and durability.', 'The AGARO HD-1120 offers excellent value for money. It provides salon-quality performance at a reasonable price, making it a worthwhile investment for those seeking a powerful and versatile hair dryer.', 'Consider your hair type and styling needs when purchasing the AGARO HD-1120. If you have fine or damaged hair, start with the lowest heat setting. Experiment with the different attachments to find the best styling options for your hair. Always use a heat protectant spray to minimize heat damage.', '**Warranty Information:**\n\n* **Duration:** 2 Years\n* **Type:** Manufacturer Warranty\n* **Coverage:** 2 Years manufacturer’s warranty. This warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship under normal use. Please contact AGARO customer support for warranty claims and assistance.', 'Q: Does it come with a diffuser?\nA: Yes, it comes with a diffuser, concentrator, and comb attachment.\n\nQ: Is this hair dryer suitable for all hair types?\nA: Yes, the cool shot button provides a burst of cold air that effectively sets hairstyles.\n\nQ: Is the cool shot button effective?\nA: Yes, the AGARO HD-1120 is suitable for all hair types, thanks to its multiple heat and speed settings.', 'The AGARO HD-1120 Professional Hair Dryer is a powerful and versatile styling tool that offers salon-quality results at home. With its multiple heat and speed settings, included attachments, and durable build quality, it\'s an excellent choice for anyone looking to upgrade their hair styling routine. Highly recommended.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B094XSDC41?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-17 02:50:50', '2026-02-13 10:11:34', 1, 'yes'),
(21, NULL, 'B09GKDD2J2', 'AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber for Wet Skin, Blackheads Remover and Facial Pores Cleaner with 4 Modes, Stainless Steel Spatula Safe for Skin, 2 Silicone Covers Included, Rechargeable, White', 'AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber Review: Deep Clean & Blackhead Removal', 'Glam 21', 'Beauty', 'AGARO,facial scrubber,skin scrubber,blackhead remover,pore cleaner,ultrasonic,skin care,exfoliation,personal care', 'The AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber offers a deep and effective way to cleanse your skin, remove blackheads, and minimize pores using high-frequency vibrations and a stainless steel spatula. Designed for use on wet skin, it provides a gentle yet powerful exfoliation experience.', '* 24000/min high-frequency vibration for deep skin cleaning\n* Water-based exfoliation technology - must be used on wet skin\n* 100% stainless steel spatula, safe for skin\n* 4 Modes for different skin needs', '* Vibration Frequency: 24000/min\n* Spatula Material: 100% Stainless Steel\n* Power Source: Not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for power information.\n* Operating Condition: Wet Skin', 1.5, 125, '* Deeply cleanses pores and removes blackheads\n* Gentle exfoliation suitable for sensitive skin\n* Stainless steel spatula is hygienic and durable\n* Multiple modes cater to different skin concerns\n* Compact and easy to use', '* Requires wet skin for proper operation\n* May not be as effective on very stubborn blackheads\n* Battery life information not readily available', 'Individuals looking for a non-abrasive method to exfoliate their skin, remove blackheads, and minimize pores at home. Suitable for those with sensitive skin who want a gentle yet effective cleansing solution.', 'Individuals with extremely sensitive or irritated skin, or those with skin conditions such as eczema or psoriasis, should consult a dermatologist before use. Those looking for immediate, dramatic results may find the effects subtle.', 'Deep cleansing of facial pores, blackhead removal, gentle exfoliation, improving skin texture, reducing the appearance of pores.', 'The AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber delivers noticeable improvements in skin texture and clarity with consistent use. The high-frequency vibrations effectively loosen and remove dirt, oil, and dead skin cells, leaving the skin feeling smoother and cleaner. The different modes allow for customized treatment based on individual skin needs.', 'The device features a sleek and ergonomic design, making it comfortable to hold and use. The stainless steel spatula is durable and hygienic. The overall build quality feels solid and well-made.', 'The AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber is incredibly easy to use. Simply wet your face, select the desired mode, and gently glide the spatula over your skin. No complicated setup or additional tools are required.', 'Battery life and power information not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for battery information.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to manual exfoliation methods, the AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber offers a gentler and more effective way to remove dead skin cells and unclog pores. It is also more hygienic than using fingers or cloths. Compared to other ultrasonic scrubbers, the AGARO stands out for its stainless steel spatula and multiple modes.', 'The AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber offers excellent value for money, providing a professional-grade facial treatment at a fraction of the cost of salon visits. Its durable construction and effective performance make it a worthwhile investment for anyone looking to improve their skin\'s appearance.', 'When purchasing the AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber, ensure that you are buying from a reputable retailer to avoid counterfeit products. Read customer reviews to get a better understanding of real-world performance. Consider your skin type and sensitivity when selecting the appropriate mode.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: Can I use this on dry skin?\nA: No, this device is designed to be used on wet skin for optimal performance.\n\nQ: How often should I use the scrubber?\nA: It is recommended to use the scrubber 2-3 times per week, depending on your skin\'s sensitivity.\n\nQ: Is the spatula replaceable?\nA: Replacement spatulas are not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for replacement information.', 'The AGARO Ultrasonic Facial Skin Scrubber is a highly effective and convenient tool for achieving cleaner, smoother, and more radiant skin. Its gentle yet powerful exfoliation, multiple modes, and durable construction make it a worthwhile addition to any skincare routine. Highly recommended for those seeking a professional-grade facial treatment at home.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B09GKDD2J2?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-20 07:31:07', '2026-02-13 10:11:51', 1, 'yes'),
(22, 42, 'B0BW3W1H98', 'Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener For Women, Ceramic Coated Floating Plates Handle Lock Feature Instant Heat Up Techonoly, Super Slim and Light Weight, Travel Friendly Sutiable for All Hair Types', 'Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener Review: Sleek Styles On-the-Go', 'IKONIC', 'Personal Care Appliances', 'Ikonic,hair straightener,black beauty,ceramic,floating plates,hair styling,personal care,flat iron,hair care,straightening iron', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener offers salon-quality straightening in a super slim and lightweight design. Featuring ceramic coated floating plates and instant heat-up technology, it\'s perfect for achieving sleek, smooth styles quickly and easily.', '* 1-inch Ceramic Coated Plates: Provides smooth gliding and even heat distribution for less damage.\n* Max Temperature 210°C: Delivers optimal straightening results for various hair types.\n* PTC Heater: Ensures rapid and consistent heating for efficient styling.\n* Super Slim and Lightweight Design: Offers comfortable handling and easy portability.\n* Handle Lock Feature: Allows for convenient storage and prevents accidental opening.', '* Plate Material: Ceramic Coated\n* Temperature Range: Up to 210°C\n* Heating Technology: PTC Heater\n* Dimensions: Super Slim and Lightweight\n* Special Features: Floating Plates, Handle Lock', 4.5, 14, '* Heats up quickly, saving time during styling.\n* Ceramic plates glide smoothly, minimizing hair damage.\n* Lightweight and easy to handle, reducing arm fatigue.\n* Reaches a high temperature for effective straightening.\n* Handle lock makes it convenient for travel and storage.', '* No temperature control, only a maximum temperature setting.\n* May not be suitable for very fine or damaged hair due to the high heat.\n* Cord length could be longer for better maneuverability.', 'Individuals looking for a quick and efficient hair straightener for daily use. Those who travel frequently and need a lightweight, portable styling tool. People with normal to thick hair who want sleek, straight styles.', 'Individuals with very fine, damaged, or chemically treated hair, as the high heat may cause further damage. Those who prefer precise temperature control for customized styling.', 'Daily hair straightening for achieving sleek and smooth styles. Quick touch-ups for maintaining straight hair throughout the day. Traveling and styling on-the-go due to its lightweight and compact design.', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener performs exceptionally well in straightening hair quickly and efficiently. The ceramic plates ensure even heat distribution, resulting in smooth, frizz-free results. The PTC heater allows for rapid heat-up, making it ideal for busy mornings.', 'The straightener boasts a sleek, black design with a slim profile, making it comfortable to hold and maneuver. The ceramic plates are well-constructed and durable. The handle lock feature adds to its overall convenience and portability.', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener is incredibly easy to use. Simply plug it in, wait for it to heat up (which is very quick), and start straightening. The floating plates adjust to the hair\'s thickness, ensuring even contact and smooth results.', 'This is a corded hair straightener and does not have a battery. It requires a standard power outlet to operate.', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener is compatible with standard power outlets. No connectivity features are included.', 'Compared to other straighteners in its price range, the Ikonic Black Beauty stands out for its rapid heat-up time and lightweight design. While some competitors offer adjustable temperature settings, the Ikonic prioritizes simplicity and ease of use.', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener offers excellent value for money. Its performance, ease of use, and portability make it a worthwhile investment for those seeking a reliable and affordable styling tool.', 'Consider your hair type and styling needs before purchasing. If you have fine or damaged hair, use a heat protectant spray to minimize potential damage. Always unplug the straightener after use and allow it to cool down completely before storing.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: How long does it take to heat up?\nA: The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener heats up in seconds thanks to its PTC heater.\n\nQ: Is it suitable for all hair types?\nA: It\'s best suited for normal to thick hair. Fine or damaged hair may require extra caution and heat protectant.\n\nQ: Can I adjust the temperature?\nA: No, the straightener has a fixed maximum temperature of 210°C.', 'The Ikonic Black Beauty Hair Straightener is a fantastic choice for those seeking a quick, efficient, and portable styling tool. Its rapid heat-up, smooth ceramic plates, and lightweight design make it ideal for daily use and travel. While it lacks temperature control, its overall performance and value make it a worthwhile purchase.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0BW3W1H98?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-20 14:20:43', '2026-02-13 10:12:06', 1, 'no');
