(23, 44, 'B0DJGKCZ9G', 'AGARO CM2407 Facial Cleansing Massager with Sonic Vibration Technique, 5 Cleaning Modes, Waterproof, Soft Silicone Bristles, Handheld, Black', 'AGARO CM2407 Facial Cleansing Massager Review: Sonic Clean for Radiant Skin', 'AGARO', 'Personal Care Appliances', 'AGARO,facial cleansing massager,sonic vibration,skincare,deep clean,exfoliation,waterproof,silicone bristles,personal care,beauty', 'The AGARO CM2407 is a handheld facial cleansing massager utilizing sonic vibration technology for a deep and gentle cleanse. With 5 customizable modes and waterproof design, it\'s a convenient addition to your skincare routine.', '* Sonic Vibration Technology: Delivers a deep and effective facial cleanse.\n* 5 Cleaning Modes: Soft, Comfort, Normal, Strong, and Eye Protection for customized skincare.\n* Soft Silicone Bristles: Gentle on the skin, suitable for daily use.\n* Waterproof Design: Safe for use in the shower or bath.\n* Handheld Design: Ergonomic and easy to maneuver for thorough cleansing.', '* Model: CM2407\n* Technology: Sonic Vibration\n* Modes: 5 (Soft, Comfort, Normal, Strong, Eye Protection)\n* Material: Soft Silicone\n* Waterproof: Yes', 4.4, 85, '* Deep and effective facial cleansing.\n* Customizable cleaning modes for different skin types.\n* Gentle silicone bristles minimize irritation.\n* Waterproof design for convenient use.\n* Compact and handheld for easy handling.', '* May be too intense for very sensitive skin on the \'Strong\' mode.\n* Requires occasional charging (charging time not specified).\n* No automatic shut-off feature.', 'Individuals looking for a deeper and more effective facial cleansing experience than manual washing. Suitable for most skin types, especially those with oily or acne-prone skin, seeking to improve skin texture and radiance.', 'People with extremely sensitive skin or conditions like rosacea should exercise caution and start with the \'Soft\' mode. Those who prefer manual cleansing methods may not find this product necessary.', 'Daily facial cleansing to remove dirt, oil, and makeup residue. Exfoliating dead skin cells for smoother and brighter skin. Gentle massage to improve blood circulation and promote collagen production.', 'The AGARO CM2407 effectively removes impurities and dead skin cells, leaving the skin feeling clean and refreshed. The sonic vibration technology provides a deeper cleanse compared to manual washing, resulting in improved skin texture and radiance with regular use. The different modes allow for customization based on individual skin sensitivity.', 'The device features a sturdy and ergonomic handheld design. The soft silicone bristles are gentle on the skin and easy to clean. The waterproof construction ensures durability and safe use in wet environments. The black color gives it a sleek and modern look.', 'The AGARO CM2407 is very easy to use. Simply apply your favorite cleanser to your face or the brush head, select your desired mode, and gently massage your face in circular motions. Cleaning the device is also straightforward, simply rinse with water after each use.', 'Battery life details not specified in product information. It is rechargeable, but the charging time and battery life per charge are not readily available. Please refer to the product manual or manufacturer\'s website for specific battery information.', 'This device does not have any connectivity features. It is a standalone facial cleansing massager.', 'Compared to other facial cleansing brushes like the Foreo Luna, the AGARO CM2407 offers a similar sonic vibration technology at a more affordable price point. While it may lack some of the advanced features of higher-end models, it provides excellent value for money for basic facial cleansing needs.', 'The AGARO CM2407 offers excellent value for money. It provides a deep and effective facial cleanse at a fraction of the cost of more expensive brands. The durable construction and waterproof design ensure long-lasting use.', 'Consider your skin type and sensitivity when choosing a cleaning mode. Start with the \'Soft\' mode if you have sensitive skin. Use the device regularly for best results. Always clean the device thoroughly after each use. Avoid using harsh or abrasive cleansers.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: Is the AGARO CM2407 suitable for sensitive skin?\nA: Yes, it has a \'Soft\' mode specifically designed for sensitive skin. Start with this mode and gradually increase the intensity as needed.\n\nQ: Is the device waterproof?\nA: Yes, the AGARO CM2407 is fully waterproof and safe to use in the shower or bath.\n\nQ: How often should I use the facial cleansing massager?\nA: You can use it daily, but it depends on your skin type. Start with a few times a week and adjust based on your skin\'s reaction.', 'The AGARO CM2407 Facial Cleansing Massager is a great option for those seeking a deep and effective facial cleanse at an affordable price. Its customizable modes, gentle silicone bristles, and waterproof design make it a convenient and versatile addition to any skincare routine. Recommended for most skin types looking to improve skin texture and radiance.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DJGKCZ9G?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-20 14:22:00', '2026-02-13 10:13:43', 1, 'no'),
(24, NULL, 'B0CS6VC6QL', 'PROTOUCH Electric Dermaplaning Device | Beauty Tool | 2 in 1 Eyebrow & Face Hair Remover with Gentle Exfoliation | Quick, Painless, Smoother & Glowing Skin | 3 attachment | Easy & Safe to Use', 'PROTOUCH Electric Dermaplaning Device: Achieve Spa-Quality Skin at Home', 'PROTOUCH', 'Luxury Beauty', 'PROTOUCH, dermaplaning, electric dermaplaning, facial hair removal, eyebrow trimmer, exfoliation, beauty tool, skincare, glowing skin, luxury beauty', 'The PROTOUCH Electric Dermaplaning Device offers a convenient and effective way to achieve smoother, more radiant skin at home. This 2-in-1 tool gently removes facial hair and exfoliates, revealing a brighter complexion.', '* Electric Dermaplaning Tool: Professional-grade facial hair removal and exfoliation.\n* Quick, Easy & Safe to Use: 3 customizable speeds for tailored skincare.\n* 2-in-1 Functionality: Removes facial hair and gently exfoliates the skin.\n* Promotes Glowing Skin: Reveals a brighter, smoother complexion after each use.\n* Spa-Like Results at Home: Achieve healthy and radiant skin instantly without expensive spa treatments.', '* Power Source: Battery Operated (Specify battery type if available)\n* Speed Settings: 3 Customizable Speeds\n* Head Type: Dermaplaning Blade & Eyebrow Trimmer\n* Material: (Specify material of the device and blades if available)\n* Dimensions: (Specify dimensions of the device if available)', 4.5, 125, '* Convenient and easy to use at home.\n* Provides gentle exfoliation for smoother skin.\n* Helps to remove unwanted facial hair.\n* Customizable speed settings for different skin types.\n* More affordable than professional dermaplaning treatments.', '* May require some practice to achieve optimal results.\n* Blades may need to be replaced periodically.\n* Not suitable for all skin types (consult a dermatologist if unsure).', 'Individuals looking for a convenient and affordable way to exfoliate their skin and remove unwanted facial hair at home. Those who wa