y claims and assistance.', 'Q: Is this brush suitable for all hair types?\nA: It works best on slightly wavy to moderately curly hair. Very thick or coarse hair may require multiple passes.\n\nQ: How hot does the brush get?\nA: The brush heats up to a single temperature of 200°C. The ThermoProtect technology helps to minimize heat damage.\n\nQ: Can I use this brush on wet hair?\nA: No, this brush is designed for use on dry hair only.', 'The Philips Hair Straightener Brush is a fantastic tool for achieving smooth, frizz-free hair in minutes. Its ease of use, hair-protecting features, and volumizing capabilities make it a worthwhile addition to any hair styling routine. Highly recommended for those seeking a quick and convenient way to style their hair daily.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B07Q2ZM5LS?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-14 06:09:46', '2026-02-13 12:10:51', 1, 'no'),
