(30, NULL, 'B0DHGHQRHK', '24k Gold Energy Beauty Bar Electric Vibration Facial Massage Roller Waterproof Face Skin Care T-Shaped Anti Wrinkle Massager for Forehead Cheek Neck Clavicle Arm (24K Gold Massager)', 'Blase 24K Gold Energy Beauty Bar Review: Is This Vibration Facial Massager Worth It?', 'Blase enterprise', 'Personal Care Appliances', '24k gold beauty bar, facial massager, vibration massager, anti-wrinkle massager, face skin care, T-shaped massager, Blase enterprise, personal care appliance', 'The Blase 24K Gold Energy Beauty Bar is a T-shaped electric facial massager designed to lift, tighten, and revitalize skin through gentle vibrations. It\'s waterproof and aims to reduce wrinkles on the forehead, cheeks, and neck.', '* Facial Beauty Massage Bar: Helps lift, tighten, and revitalize facial skin when used with skincare products.\n* Micro Vibration Massager: Employs vibration massage therapy, a popular beauty technology, to activate skin cells.\n* T-Shaped Bar: The T-shaped head provides mild vibration to push and pat the skin, targeting therapeutic points.\n* Waterproof Design: Allows for use in the shower or with wet skincare products without damage.\n* Compact and Portable: Easy to carry and use anytime, anywhere.', '* Material: Brass, Aluminum (Gold Plated)\n* Vibration Frequency: Approximately 6000 vibrations per minute\n* Power: 1 x AA battery (not included)\n* Dimensions: 140mm x 16mm (T-head length: 35mm)\n* Waterproof Level: Splashproof', 4.2, 85, '* May help improve skin elasticity and reduce the appearance of fine lines.\n* Waterproof design offers flexibility in usage.\n* Portable and easy to use.\n* Gentle vibration is suitable for sensitive skin.\n* Affordable compared to professional spa treatments.', '* Requires a AA battery, which is not included.\n* Vibration intensity is not adjustable.\n* Long-term effectiveness may vary depending on individual skin type and usage.', 'Individuals looking for a simple, at-home facial massage tool to potentially improve skin elasticity, reduce fine lines, and revitalize their complexion. Suitable for those who prefer a gentle, non-invasive approach to skincare.', 'Individuals with very sensitive skin or pre-existing skin conditions should consult a dermatologist before use. Those seeking immediate or dramatic results may be disappointed, as consistent use is required.', 'Daily facial massage to improve circulation and skin tone. Application of serums and moisturizers to enhance absorption. Targeting specific areas like forehead, cheeks, and neck for wrinkle reduction.', 'The Blase 24K Gold Energy Beauty Bar provides gentle vibrations that can stimulate blood flow and potentially improve the absorption of skincare products. While it may not deliver dramatic results overnight, consistent use can contribute to a more toned and revitalized complexion.', 'The device is made of brass and aluminum with gold plating. The T-shaped design allows for easy maneuvering around facial contours. The waterproof construction adds to its durability and usability.', 'Extremely easy to use. Simply insert a AA battery, turn on the device, and gently massage the face in upward and outward motions. No complicated setup or maintenance required.', 'Operates on a single AA battery (not included). Battery life depends on the quality of the battery and frequency of use. Expect several weeks to a few months of use per battery.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require any connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to other facial massagers, the Blase 24K Gold Energy Beauty Bar is a budget-friendly option. Higher-end devices may offer adjustable vibration settings or additional features, but this bar provides a simple and effective massage at an affordable price.', 'Offers good value for money for those seeking a basic and portable facial massager. Its simple design and ease of use make it a worthwhile investment for enhancing a skincare routine.', 'Consider your skin type and sensitivity before purchasing. Start with short massage sessions and gradually increase the duration as tolerated. Always use with a serum or moisturizer to avoid friction. Clean the device after each use.', 'Warranty details not specified in product information. Please check with manufacturer or retailer for warranty information.', 'Q: How often should I use this beauty bar?\nA: You can use it daily for 5-10 minutes.\n\nQ: Does it require any special skincare products?\nA: No, you can use it with your regular serums and moisturizers.\n\nQ: Is it safe for sensitive skin?\nA: It is generally safe, but if you have sensitive skin, start with shorter sessions and monitor your skin\'s reaction.', 'The Blase 24K Gold Energy Beauty Bar is a simple and affordable way to incorporate facial massage into your skincare routine. While it may not replace professional treatments, it can help improve circulation, enhance product absorption, and potentially reduce the appearance of fine lines with consistent use. Recommended for those seeking a gentle and portable facial massager.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DHGHQRHK?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-14 06:09:46', '2026-02-13 12:12:01', 1, 'no'),
(31, NULL, 'B09WYQQVVD', 'PROTOUCH 3 in 1 LED Face Mask | For Glowing & Clear Skin | Anti Acne & Anti Ageing | Facial at home | For All Skin Type | For Men & Women (unisex)', 'PROTOUCH 3-in-1 LED Face Mask: Achieve Glowing, Clear Skin at Home', 'PROTOUCH', 'Luxury Beauty', 'PROTOUCH, LED face mask, light therapy, anti-aging, anti-acne, skin care, facial, beauty, luxury beauty, home facial', 'The PROTOUCH 3-in-1 LED Face Mask offers a luxurious at-home facial experience, targeting acne, aging, and overall skin radiance with advanced light therapy.', '* 3-in-1 LED light therapy for comprehensive skin treatment\n* Red light therapy stimulates collagen production for anti-aging benefits\n* Blue light therapy targets acne-causing bacteria for clearer skin\n* Suitable for all skin types, including men and women\n* Provides a convenient and effective facial treatment at home', '* Light Therapy: Red and Blue LED lights\n* Skin Type: Suitable for all skin types\n* Usage: At-home facial treatment\n* Gender: Unisex\n* Features: Anti-aging, Anti-acne, Skin rejuvenation', 4.6, 85, '* Convenient at-home facial treatment\n* Targets multiple skin concerns simultaneously\n* Non-invasive and painless light therapy\n* Suitable for all skin types\n* Can improve skin tone and texture', '* Requires consistent use for noticeable results\n* May not be as effective as professional treatments for severe skin conditions\n* Initial cost may be higher than some other skincare options', 'Individuals looking for a convenient and effective at-home facial treatment to address acne, aging, and overall skin radiance. Those who prefer non-invasive skincare solutions and are willing to invest in a luxury beauty device.', 'Individuals with very sensitive skin or pre-existing skin conditions should consult a dermatologist before using this product. Those seeking immediate and dramatic results may be better suited for professional treatments.', 'Reducing acne breakouts, minimizing fine lines and wrinkles, improving skin tone and texture, achieving a radiant complexion, and maintaining overall skin health.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Face Mask delivers noticeable improvements in skin clarity and texture with consistent use. The red light therapy effectively stimulates collagen production, while the blue light therapy reduces acne-causing bacteria, resulting in a smoother, more radiant complexion.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Face Mask is constructed with high-quality materials and features an ergonomic design for comfortable wear. The mask is lightweight and easy to use, making it a convenient addition to any skincare routine. The design ensures optimal light exposure to the entire face.', 'The PROTOUCH LED Face Mask is incredibly easy to use. Simply cleanse your face, select the desired light therapy mode, and wear the mask for the recommended duration. No complicated setup or additional products are required.', 'This product is typically powered by a rechargeable battery. Battery life allows for multiple uses before needing to be recharged. Check product manual for specific details.', 'This is a standalone device and does not require connectivity or compatibility with other devices.', 'Compared to other LED face masks, the PROTOUCH 3-in-1 offers a comprehensive solution with both red and blue light therapy. Its ergonomic design and ease of use make it a standout choice in the luxury beauty market.', 'While the PROTOUCH LED Face Mask represents a significant investment, its ability to address multiple skin concerns and provide long-term benefits makes it a worthwhile purchase for those seeking a luxurious and effective at-home skincare solution.', 'Consider your specific skin concerns and desired results when purchasing an LED face mask. Look for a product with multiple light therapy options and a comfortable design. Read reviews and compare prices to ensure you are making an informed decision.', '**Warranty Information:**\n\nThe PROTOUCH 3-in-1 LED Face Mask comes with a manufacturer\'s warranty for your peace of mind.\n\n*   **Duration:** 6 Months\n*   **Type:** Manufacturer Warranty\n*   **Coverage:** ✅ 6 Months warranty', 'Q: How often should I use the PROTOUCH LED Face Mask?\nA: For best results, use the mask 2-3 times per week for 10-15 minutes per session.\n\nQ: Is the PROTOUCH LED Face Mask safe for all skin types?\nA: Yes, the mask is suitable for all skin types. However, individuals with sensitive skin should start with shorter sessions and gradually increase the duration.\n\nQ: Can I use the mask with other skincare products?\nA: Yes, you can use the mask with your favorite skincare products. Apply your serums and moisturizers after using the mask for optimal absorption.', 'The PROTOUCH 3-in-1 LED Face Mask is a worthwhile investment for those seeking a convenient and effective at-home facial treatment. Its ability to address multiple skin concerns and deliver noticeable results makes it a top choice in the luxury beauty market. Highly recommended for achieving glowing, clear skin.', 'https://www.amazon.in/dp/B09WYQQVVD?tag=affliate0ade-21&linkCode=ogi&th=1&psc=1', 'As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases. This post contains affiliate links.', '2026-02-14 06:09:46', '2026-02-13 12:12:15', 1, 'no');
